/* MacBattery English strings
 *
 * Conventions (must match zh-Hans.lproj/Localizable.strings key for key):
 * 1. Missing keys fall back to the default language (Simplified Chinese) at runtime,
 *    but a missing key also fails the key-parity test in CI — so always add both.
 * 2. Plurals use <key>.one / <key>.other. English needs both.
 * 3. Format strings use String(format:) syntax; arguments are locale-formatted.
 * 4. language.* holds language autonyms (简体中文 / English) — do NOT translate.
 */

